{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/6712","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:09.110077+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"In the short-term we could insert a bitcast there (now that we have it) during hal->vm conversion. Long-term we'll probably want to remove the hal.buffer.load/store runtime functional entirely (as it presumes fast local memory access) and at most provide a way to read into/write from vm.buffers where we can reuse the existing vm ops for typed load/stores.","created_at":"2021-08-09T23:08:07Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/6712#issuecomment-895609506","id":895609506,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/6712","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M41Yeqi","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/895609506/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-09T23:08:07Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/895609506","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"So make `BufferLoadOpConversion` produce something like this?\r\n\r\n```mlir\r\n%10 = \"vm.call\"(%8, %5, %9) {callee = @hal.buffer.load} : (!vm.ref<!hal.buffer>, i32, i32) -> i32\r\n%11 = vm.bitcast.i32.f32 %10 : i32 -> f32\r\n\"vm.br\"(%0, %11)[^bb1] : (f32, f32) -> ()\r\n```","created_at":"2021-08-09T23:12:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/6712#issuecomment-895611747","id":895611747,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/6712","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M41YfNj","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/895611747/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-09T23:12:39Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/895611747","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","id":4010439,"login":"ScottTodd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"I think so - and the reverse for stores.","created_at":"2021-08-09T23:19:54Z","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/6712#issuecomment-895615119","id":895615119,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/6712","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDODGgK6M41YgCP","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":1,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":1,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/895615119/reactions"},"updated_at":"2021-08-09T23:19:54Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/comments/895615119","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75337?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/benvanik","id":75337,"login":"benvanik","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MzM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/benvanik","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","id":4010439,"login":"ScottTodd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","id":4010439,"login":"ScottTodd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"MEMBER","body":"Found while working on https://github.com/google/iree/issues/1159 with local changes, so plenty of things could be misconfigured. I'm mainly wondering at which level this error I'm encountering should be addressed.\r\n\r\nI'm starting from a `flow.tensor.load %0 : tensor<f32>`, which eventually gets down to this error during `IREE::VM::ConversionPass`:\r\n```mlir\r\nD:\\dev\\projects\\iree/../iree-data/tests/collatz.mlir:15:5: error: type mismatch for bb argument #1 of successor #0\r\n    br ^bb1(%cst_3, %arg0 : tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>)\r\n    ^\r\nD:\\dev\\projects\\iree/../iree-data/tests/collatz.mlir:3:3: note: called from\r\n  func @collatz(%arg0: !hal.buffer_view) -> !hal.buffer_view attributes {iree.abi = \"{\\22a\\22:[[\\22ndarray\\22,\\22f32\\22,0]],\\22r\\22:[[\\22ndarray\\22,\\22f32\\22,0]],\\22v\\22:1}\"} {\r\n  ^\r\nD:\\dev\\projects\\iree/../iree-data/tests/collatz.mlir:15:5: note: see current operation: \"vm.br\"(%0, %10)[^bb1] : (f32, i32) -> ()\r\n    br ^bb1(%cst_3, %arg0 : tensor<f32>, tensor<f32>)\r\n    ^\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Main IR causing the issue\r\n\r\nbefore ConvertToHAL\r\n```mlir\r\n    %0 = hal.tensor.cast %arg0 : !hal.buffer_view -> tensor<f32>\r\n    %1 = flow.tensor.load %0 : tensor<f32>\r\n    br ^bb1(%cst, %1 : f32, f32)\r\n  ^bb1(%2: f32, %3: f32):  // 3 preds: ^bb0, ^bb3, ^bb4\r\n    %4 = cmpf ogt, %3, %cst_1 : f32\r\n```\r\n\r\nafter ConvertToHAL\r\n```mlir\r\n    %off = hal.buffer_view.compute_offset %arg0, indices = [] : index\r\n    %buffer = hal.buffer_view.buffer %arg0 : !hal.buffer\r\n    %0 = hal.buffer.load<%buffer : !hal.buffer>[%off] : f32\r\n    br ^bb1(%cst, %0 : f32, f32)\r\n  ^bb1(%1: f32, %2: f32):  // 3 preds: ^bb0, ^bb3, ^bb4\r\n    %4 = cmpf ogt, %3, %cst_1 : f32\r\n```\r\n\r\nduring VM conversion\r\nnote the hal.buffer.load call and `vm.br` now use `i32` while `^bb1` is still expecting `f32`\r\n```mlir\r\n      %8 = \"vm.call\"(%arg0) {callee = @hal.buffer_view.buffer} : (!vm.ref<!hal.buffer_view>) -> !vm.ref<!hal.buffer>\r\n      %9 = \"vm.const.i32\"() {value = 4 : i32} : () -> i32\r\n      %10 = \"vm.call\"(%8, %5, %9) {callee = @hal.buffer.load} : (!vm.ref<!hal.buffer>, i32, i32) -> i32\r\n      \"vm.br\"(%0, %10)[^bb1] : (f32, i32) -> ()\r\n    ^bb1(%11: f32, %12: f32):  // 3 preds: ^bb0, ^bb3, ^bb4\r\n      %13 = \"vm.cmp.gt.f32.o\"(%12, %2) : (f32, f32) -> i32\r\n```\r\n\r\nfull IR in [this gist](https://gist.github.com/ScottTodd/fe6709362cef9ff93d6e8a623cce086e)\r\n\r\n### Looking at the code\r\n\r\nThe HAL->VM lowering gets the return type for `BufferLoadOp` from imports:\r\nhttps://github.com/google/iree/blob/36d3efcb3fb4fda86c4cbb947ebf17c8ef22131f/iree/compiler/Dialect/HAL/Conversion/HALToVM/ConvertBufferOps.cpp#L28-L35\r\nhttps://github.com/google/iree/blob/36d3efcb3fb4fda86c4cbb947ebf17c8ef22131f/iree/compiler/Dialect/HAL/hal.imports.mlir#L58-L63\r\n\r\nbut the op is defined as returning any `HAL_PrimitiveType`: https://github.com/google/iree/blob/36d3efcb3fb4fda86c4cbb947ebf17c8ef22131f/iree/compiler/Dialect/HAL/IR/HALOps.td#L726-L728\r\nhttps://github.com/google/iree/blob/36d3efcb3fb4fda86c4cbb947ebf17c8ef22131f/iree/compiler/Dialect/HAL/IR/HALBase.td#L367","closed_at":"2021-08-11T16:07:23Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4010439?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ScottTodd","id":4010439,"login":"ScottTodd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMTA0Mzk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ScottTodd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/6712/comments","created_at":"2021-08-09T22:44:47Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iree-org/iree/issues/6712/events","html_url":"https://github.com/iree-org/iree/issues/6712","id":96444679